        "parms": "# seq — MIDI recorded and played back\nA seq records raw MIDI bytes, each with the time since the one before, and plays them back in the same rhythm. Here midiformat turns the upper keyboard into bytes, and midiparse turns the playback back into notes for the lower keyboard. Time is counted in audio blocks. The sequence is not saved with the patch: read and write keep it in a MIDI file.",
